{"code":"bn","name":"Bengali","native":"বাংলা","phase":2,"medium":"en","file_level":"B1","level":{"title":"Intermediate: commands, obligation, family, opinions","goals":["Command politely and express have-to","Talk family and ages","Argue opinions and describe weather"],"units":[{"id":"B1-U1","title":"Commands and obligation","lessons":[{"id":"B1-U1-L1","title":"খাও/খান + না","learn":"Orders, two levels! খাও (eat, casual), খান (eat, formal)! বসো/বসুন (sit), এসো/আসুন (come)! Soften: দয়া করে বসুন = Please sit. Don't: না — যেও না! (Don't go!)!","vocab":[{"t":"বসো","r":"bôsho","en":"sit! (casual)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"ওঠো","r":"oṭho","en":"get up! (casual)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"এসো","r":"æsho","en":"come! (casual)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"যাও","r":"jao","en":"go! (casual)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"খোলো","r":"kholo","en":"open! (casual)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"বন্ধ করো","r":"bôndho kôro","en":"close! (casual)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"শোনো","r":"shono","en":"listen! (casual)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"দেখো","r":"dekho","en":"look! (casual)","pos":"verb"}],"grammar":{"title":"-ও/-উন · না…না (don't)","explain":"বসো (sit, casual), বসুন (sit, formal)! বলো/বলুন (tell). Don't: যেও না! (don't go!), বোলো না! (don't speak!) — verb-ও + না!","pattern":"-ও (friends) · -উন (elders) · ও + না","examples":[{"t":"দয়া করে বসুন!","r":"dôya kôre boshun!","en":"Please sit! (formal)"},{"t":"এখানে এসো!","r":"ækhane æsho!","en":"Come here! (casual)"},{"t":"যেও না!","r":"jeo na!","en":"Don't go!"}],"mistakes":["Saying বসো to elders — elders get বসুন!","Saying না যাও for don't — don't: যেও না!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"এখানে এসো!","r":"ækhane æsho!","en":"Come here! (casual)"},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"আমি ব্যস্ত! ওখানে যাও!","r":"ami byasto! okhane jao!","en":"I'm busy! Go there!"},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"আচ্ছা! দয়া করে বসুন!","r":"achchha! dôya kôre boshun!","en":"OK! Please sit! (formal)"},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"ধন্যবাদ!","r":"dhonyobad!","en":"Thanks!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say (formal): Please sit!","answer":"দয়া করে বসুন"},{"type":"fill","q":"___ না! (Don't go)","answer":"যেও"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Come here! (casual)' is…","options":["এখানে আসুন","এখানে এসো","এখানে আয়","এখানে আসা"],"answer":"এখানে এসো"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: বসুন / করে / দয়া","answer":"দয়া করে বসুন"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: এখানে এসো!","answer":"এখানে এসো!"}],"quiz":[{"q":"-উন is for…","options":["friends","elders / formal","kids","self"],"answer":1,"why":"বসুন — formal sit."},{"q":"-ও is for…","options":["elders","friends / casual","bosses","strangers"],"answer":1,"why":"বসো — casual."},{"q":"যেও না means…","options":["go quickly","don't go","go later","come here"],"answer":1,"why":"ও + না = don't!"},{"q":"খোলো means…","options":["close!","open!","sit!","go!"],"answer":1,"why":"খোলো = open! (casual)"},{"q":"দয়া করে makes orders…","options":["stronger","polite","plural","past"],"answer":1,"why":"দয়া করে = please."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Commands worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Bengali.","items":["sit! (casual)","come! (casual)","listen! (casual)"],"key":["বসো","এসো","শোনো"]},{"instruction":"Command people.","items":["Please sit! (formal)","Come here! (casual)","Don't go!"],"key":["দয়া করে বসুন","এখানে এসো","যেও না"]},{"instruction":"Boss around.","items":["Go there! (casual)","Thanks!"],"key":["ওখানে যাও","ধন্যবাদ"]}]}},{"id":"B1-U1-L2","title":"আমাকে যেতে হবে (have to)","learn":"Compulsion! আমাকে যেতে হবে = I HAVE to go. আমাকে কাজ করতে হবে (I have to work). Past: আমাকে যেতে হয়েছিল (I had to go). Verb stays -তে, only হবে moves!","vocab":[{"t":"যাওয়া","r":"jaoa","en":"to go","pos":"verb"},{"t":"আসা","r":"asha","en":"to come","pos":"verb"},{"t":"করা","r":"kôra","en":"to do","pos":"verb"},{"t":"দেওয়া","r":"deoa","en":"to give","pos":"verb"},{"t":"নেওয়া","r":"neoa","en":"to take","pos":"verb"},{"t":"কঠিন","r":"koṭhin","en":"difficult","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"সহজ","r":"shôhoj","en":"easy","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"জরুরি","r":"joruri","en":"necessary","pos":"adjective"}],"grammar":{"title":"আমাকে X-তে হবে/হয়েছিল","explain":"আমাকে যেতে হবে (I have to go), আমাকে যেতে হয়েছিল (I had to go), আমাকে যেতে হবে (will have to — same!). -তে frozen, হবে moves!","pattern":"আমাকে + verb-তে + হবে","examples":[{"t":"আমাকে স্কুলে যেতে হবে।","r":"amake skule jete hôbe.","en":"I have to go to school."},{"t":"আমাকে কাজ করতে হয়েছিল।","r":"amake kaj kôrte hôyechhilo.","en":"I had to work."},{"t":"তোমাকে কী করতে হবে?","r":"tomake ki kôrte hôbe?","en":"What do you have to do?"}],"mistakes":["Saying আমি যেতে হবে — have-to needs আমাকে!","Changing -তে: যেতে stays যেতে!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"মিতা","t":"তোমাকে কী করতে হবে?","r":"tomake ki kôrte hôbe?","en":"What do you have to do? (casual)"},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"আমাকে স্কুলে যেতে হবে। তোমাকে?","r":"amake skule jete hôbe. tomake?","en":"I have to go to school. And you?"},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"আমাকে কাজ করতে হবে। কঠিন!","r":"amake kaj kôrte hôbe. koṭhin!","en":"I have to work. Difficult!"},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"কোনো ব্যাপার না!","r":"kono byapar na!","en":"No problem!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I have to go to school","answer":"আমাকে স্কুলে যেতে হবে"},{"type":"fill","q":"আমাকে কাজ করতে ___। (had to)","answer":"হয়েছিল"},{"type":"choose","q":"'What do you have to do?' is…","options":["তুমি কী করো","তোমাকে কী করতে হবে","তুমি কী করবে","তুমি কী করলে"],"answer":"তোমাকে কী করতে হবে"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: হবে / যেতে / স্কুলে / আমাকে","answer":"আমাকে স্কুলে যেতে হবে"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: আমাকে স্কুলে যেতে হবে।","answer":"আমাকে স্কুলে যেতে হবে।"}],"quiz":[{"q":"আমাকে যেতে হবে means…","options":["I go","I have to go","I went","I want to go"],"answer":1,"why":"আমাকে + তে + হবে = must."},{"q":"হয়েছিল means…","options":["is","had to / happened","will be","want"],"answer":1,"why":"হয়েছিল = past compulsion."},{"q":"-তে in যেতে হবে…","options":["changes tense","never changes","drops","doubles"],"answer":1,"why":"যেতে frozen; হবে moves."},{"q":"কঠিন means…","options":["easy","difficult","fast","slow"],"answer":1,"why":"কঠিন = difficult."},{"q":"জরুরি means…","options":["free","necessary","ready","late"],"answer":1,"why":"জরুরি = necessary."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Have-to worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Bengali.","items":["to go","difficult","necessary"],"key":["যাওয়া","কঠিন","জরুরি"]},{"instruction":"Compulsions.","items":["I have to go to school","I had to work","What do you have to do?"],"key":["আমাকে স্কুলে যেতে হবে","আমাকে কাজ করতে হয়েছিল","তোমাকে কী করতে হবে"]},{"instruction":"Sympathise.","items":["Difficult!","No problem!"],"key":["কঠিন","কোনো ব্যাপার না"]}]}}]},{"id":"B1-U2","title":"Family and age","lessons":[{"id":"B1-U2-L1","title":"Family: পরিবার","learn":"Family! বাবা (dad), মা (mum), ভাই (brother), বোন (sister), ছেলে/মেয়ে (son/daughter). আমার/তোমার/আপনার never change — owner's word stays, owned thing free!","vocab":[{"t":"পরিবার","r":"poribar","en":"family","pos":"noun"},{"t":"বাবা","r":"baba","en":"father","pos":"noun"},{"t":"মা","r":"ma","en":"mother","pos":"noun"},{"t":"ভাই","r":"bhai","en":"brother","pos":"noun"},{"t":"বোন","r":"bon","en":"sister","pos":"noun"},{"t":"ছেলে","r":"chhele","en":"son / boy","pos":"noun"},{"t":"মেয়ে","r":"meye","en":"daughter / girl","pos":"noun"},{"t":"বাবা-মা","r":"baba-ma","en":"parents","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"আমার/তোমার/আপনার (frozen!)","explain":"আমার ভাই (my brother), আমার বোন (my sister), আমার বন্ধুরা (my friends)! Possessives NEVER agree — same word always!","pattern":"আমার/তোমার/আপনার + anything","examples":[{"t":"আমার বাবা শিক্ষক।","r":"amar baba shikkhôk.","en":"My father is a teacher."},{"t":"তোমার মা?","r":"tomar ma?","en":"And your mother? (casual)"},{"t":"আমার পরিবার বড়।","r":"amar poribar bôṛo.","en":"My family is big."}],"mistakes":["Changing আমার by gender — possessives NEVER change!","Saying আমি বাবা — my: আমার!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"মিতা","t":"তোমার পরিবারে কয়জন?","r":"tomar poribare kôyjôn?","en":"How many in your family? (casual)"},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"চারজন। বাবা-মা আর আমি।","r":"charjôn. baba-ma ar ami.","en":"Four people. Parents and me (and one more)!"},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"তোমার ভাই আছে?","r":"tomar bhai achhe?","en":"Do you have a brother?"},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"হ্যাঁ, আমার এক ভাই আছে!","r":"hyãn, amar æk bhai achhe!","en":"Yes, I have a brother!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: My father is a teacher","answer":"আমার বাবা শিক্ষক"},{"type":"fill","q":"___ বোন (My sister)","answer":"আমার"},{"type":"choose","q":"'How many in your family?' is…","options":["তোমার পরিবার কী","তোমার পরিবারে কয়জন","তোমার পরিবার কোথায়","তোমার পরিবার কে"],"answer":"তোমার পরিবারে কয়জন"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: শিক্ষক / বাবা / আমার","answer":"আমার বাবা শিক্ষক"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: আমার বাবা শিক্ষক।","answer":"আমার বাবা শিক্ষক।"}],"quiz":[{"q":"আমার বোন uses আমার because…","options":["plural","possessives never change","formal","past"],"answer":1,"why":"আমার for all!."},{"q":"কয়জন counts…","options":["things","people","books","days"],"answer":1,"why":"জন = people counter."},{"q":"বাবা-মা means…","options":["brothers","parents","children","family"],"answer":1,"why":"বাবা-মা = parents."},{"q":"মেয়ে means…","options":["son","daughter / girl","sister","mother"],"answer":1,"why":"মেয়ে = girl/daughter."},{"q":"তোমার means…","options":["my","your (casual)","his","our"],"answer":1,"why":"তোমার = your."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Family worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Bengali.","items":["family","father","daughter"],"key":["পরিবার","বাবা","মেয়ে"]},{"instruction":"Own things.","items":["My father is a teacher","My sister","My friends"],"key":["আমার বাবা শিক্ষক","আমার বোন","আমার বন্ধুরা"]},{"instruction":"Count family.","items":["How many in your family? (casual)","Four people"],"key":["তোমার পরিবারে কয়জন","চারজন"]}]}},{"id":"B1-U2-L2","title":"Age: বয়স","learn":"Age: বয়স কত? (How old?) → আমার বিশ বছর (I'm 20). বছর counts years! Birthdays: জন্মদিন কবে? → মার্চে! Months: মাস, dates: তারিখ!","vocab":[{"t":"বয়স","r":"bôyosh","en":"age","pos":"noun"},{"t":"কত বছর","r":"kôto bôchhôr","en":"how many years","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"বিশ বছর","r":"bish bôchhôr","en":"20 years","pos":"noun"},{"t":"জন্মদিন","r":"jônmodin","en":"birthday","pos":"noun"},{"t":"কবে","r":"kôbe","en":"when","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"প্রতি বছর","r":"proti bôchhôr","en":"every year","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"অভিনন্দন","r":"obhinôndon","en":"congratulations","pos":"noun"},{"t":"কেক","r":"kek","en":"cake","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"বছর (age) · মাস/তারিখ dates","explain":"আমার বিশ বছর (I'm 20), কুড়ি বছর (colloquial 20!). Months: জানুয়ারি, মার্চ. Dates: তিন তারিখ (3rd)!","pattern":"আমার + number + বছর","examples":[{"t":"আমার বিশ বছর।","r":"amar bish bôchhôr.","en":"I'm twenty."},{"t":"আমার জন্মদিন মার্চে।","r":"amar jônmodin marche.","en":"My birthday is in March."},{"t":"শুভ জন্মদিন!","r":"shubho jônmodin!","en":"Happy birthday!"}],"mistakes":["Saying আমি বিশ — age: আমার…বছর!","Saying মার্চ for 'in March' — in: মার্চে!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"তোমার বয়স কত?","r":"tomar bôyosh kôto?","en":"How old are you? (casual)"},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"আমার বিশ বছর!","r":"amar bish bôchhôr!","en":"I'm twenty!"},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"তোমার জন্মদিন কবে?","r":"tomar jônmodin kôbe?","en":"When is your birthday?"},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"মার্চে!","r":"marche!","en":"In March!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I'm twenty","answer":"আমার বিশ বছর"},{"type":"fill","q":"আমার জন্মদিন ___। (in March)","answer":"মার্চে"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Happy birthday!' is…","options":["শুভ নববর্ষ","শুভ জন্মদিন","অভিনন্দন নববর্ষ","ভালো থেকো"],"answer":"শুভ জন্মদিন"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: বছর / বিশ / আমার","answer":"আমার বিশ বছর"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: আমার বিশ বছর।","answer":"আমার বিশ বছর।"}],"quiz":[{"q":"আমার বিশ বছর means…","options":["I want 20","I'm 20","I see 20","I have 20"],"answer":1,"why":"আমার + বছর = 