ink this is good."},{"t":"ঢাকা মুম্বাইয়ের চেয়ে বড়।","r":"Ḍhaka Mumbair cheye bôṛo.","en":"Dhaka is bigger than Mumbai."},{"t":"এটা সবচেয়ে ভালো!","r":"æṭa shôbcheye bhalo!","en":"This is the best!"}],"mistakes":["Saying চেয়ে ঢাকা বড় — order: A B-র চেয়ে!","Saying সবচেয়ে খুব ভালো — সবচেয়ে replaces খুব!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"মিতা","t":"আমার মনে হয় মেট্রো ভালো।","r":"amar mone hôy meṭro bhalo.","en":"I think the metro is good."},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"আমার মনে হয় গাড়ি দ্রুত।","r":"amar mone hôy gaṛi druto.","en":"I think the car is fast."},{"sp":"মিতা","t":"কিন্তু মেট্রো সস্তা!","r":"kintu meṭro shôsta!","en":"But the metro is cheap!"},{"sp":"রাতুল","t":"রাজি!","r":"raji!","en":"Agreed!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I think this is good","answer":"আমার মনে হয় এটা ভালো"},{"type":"fill","q":"এটা ___ ভালো! (most)","answer":"সবচেয়ে"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Dhaka is bigger than Mumbai' is…","options":["ঢাকা মুম্বাই বড়","ঢাকা মুম্বাইয়ের চেয়ে বড়","ঢাকা সবচেয়ে মুম্বাই বড়","চেয়ে ঢাকা মুম্বাই বড়"],"answer":"ঢাকা মুম্বাইয়ের চেয়ে বড়"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: ভালো / এটা / হয় / মনে / আমার","answer":"আমার মনে হয় এটা ভালো"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: আমার মনে হয় মেট্রো ভালো।","answer":"আমার মনে হয় মেট্রো ভালো।"}],"quiz":[{"q":"আমার মনে হয় means…","options":["I know","I think/feel","I see","I want"],"answer":1,"why":"মনে হয় = feels-to-me."},{"q":"চেয়ে marks…","options":["most","than","very","less"],"answer":1,"why":"চেয়ে = than."},{"q":"সবচেয়ে means…","options":["more","most","very","less"],"answer":1,"why":"সবচেয়ে = -est."},{"q":"খারাপ means…","options":["good","bad","big","small"],"answer":1,"why":"খারাপ = bad."},{"q":"রাজি means…","options":["disagree","agreed","maybe","never"],"answer":1,"why":"রাজি = agreed."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Opinions worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Bengali.","items":["to feel/seem","better","opinion"],"key":["মনে হওয়া","আরও ভালো","মতামত"]},{"instruction":"